# composition build tree (framework checkout + overlaid role) — never committed
.compose/

# ansible scratch
*.retry
*.log

# build worktrees live outside the repo (../.worktrees) but guard anyway
.worktrees/

# local-only secrets / scratch (never commit credentials)
*.secret
temp-password*

# Working notes and audit trail — process records, not repository content. The whole tree is
# ignored and was purged from history, so nothing under it can reach a commit by any path.
# The files stay on disk and are read by every session.
**/_handoff/

# Local operating notes, role contracts and position tracking. Deliberately kept out of the
# repository: they describe how the work is organised, not what the software does.
ROADMAP.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
docs/session-runbook.md
